  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trade Transparency Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To  improve global consumers&#x2019; understanding of how trade affects them by making complex trade data more transparent and easy to understand.  This will lead to greater citizen engagement with government on trade policy issues, resulting in more effective trade policies which will underpin future economic growth and poverty reduction.</narrative>
  </description>
